# Public OAuth Client ID for "Continue with Google" on the Patient Login page.
# This value is NOT secret (Google client IDs are meant to be public — they
# identify the app, not authenticate it) and is safe to expose in frontend code.
# Never put the Google Client SECRET here; that stays only in the backend .env.
#
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# (Create Credentials -> OAuth client ID -> Web application ->
#  add your dev origin, e.g. http://localhost:5173, as an Authorized JavaScript origin)
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
